    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting though. i try to \"make changes\" or go out or do things, but the grayness is always there underneath it all. it's like a constant, low-level hum of nothingness. i feel like i'm just running on a treadmill getting nowhere. i'm so tired of pretending to be a person. i just want it to stop. i just want the quiet.",
